								<tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__0">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>24/7 Legal & Regulatory Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Explores the legal and regulatory considerations related to 24/7 trading and clearing, including responding to the CFTC's RFC on energy derivatives and perpetual contracts</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ccaaa3beb9a1bf8caaa5ade2a3beabf3bfb9aea6a9afb8f1fef8e3fbec80a9abada0ece9fefaec9ea9abb9a0adb8a3beb5ec9ba3bea7a5a2abec8bbea3b9bcece1ec82adb8ada0a5a9ec98b5a2ada2" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">247LRWG</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__1">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Algo Trading Distribution List</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Updates FIA members on algorithmic trading topics.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Tessa Jones</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#aec8c1dcdbc3ddeec8c7cf80c1dcc991dddbccc4cbcdda93efc2c9c18efadccfcac7c0c98eeac7dddadcc7ccdbdac7c1c08ee2c7ddda8e838efacbddddcf8ee4c1c0cbdd" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Distribution List</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">ALGTRADISLIS</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__2">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Best Practice Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses daily issues, considerations and implementation challenges encountered by FCM Legal and Compliance personnel who are at the front line of their firms’ FCM business, and provides a forum for timely feedback from their peers.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Available upon request</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e2848d90978f91a2848b83cc8d9085dd91978088878196dfa0879196c2b2908381968b8187c2b58d90898b8c85c2a5908d9792c2cfc2ac8396838e8b87c2b69b8c838c" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">BESPRA</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__3">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Brussels Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Exchanges information on European regulatory proposals and issues. Engages with European policymakers in group discussions on  legislative proposals and collects insights on how best to pursue FIA’s advocacy efforts.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Jean Pierre Salendres</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1f79706d6a726c5f79767e31706d78206c6a7d757a7c6b225d6d6a6c6c7a736c3f5c707272766b6b7a7a3f323f557a7e713f4f767a6d6d7a3f4c7e737a717b6d7a6c" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Government Relations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">BRU</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__4">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Capital Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Identifies, monitors and addresses capital issues impacting clearing members. Responds to consultations, advocates for changes and educates policymakers and the public about the impact on clearing resulting from capital requirements.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Jackie Mesa</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#54323b2621392714323d357a3b26336b2721363e313720691735243d20353874173b39393d202031317479741e35373f3d317419312735" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Capital</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">CAP</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__5">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>CCP Risk Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Works to create industry best practices, tackle individual CCP risk items, respond to international, national and CCP consultations and advocate with regulators and CCPs on behalf of clearing members.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Jackie Mesa</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#f4929b86819987b4929d95da9b8693cb8781969e919780c9b7b7a4d4a69d879fd4b79b99999d80809191d4d9d4be95979f9d91d4b9918795" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>CCP Risk</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">CCPRIS2</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__6">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>CFTC Part 17 Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Addresses concerns related to Part 17 large trader reporting obligations and implementation of rule changes.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#a2c4cdd0d7cfd1e2c4cbc38ccdd0c59dd1d7c0c8c7c1d69fe1e4f6e182f2c3d0d682939582f5cdd0c9cbccc582e5d0cdd7d2828f82ecc3d6c3cecbc782f6dbccc3cc" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">CFTPAR17</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__7">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Chief Compliance Officer Standing Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses legal and compliance issues</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3e58514c4b534d7e58575f10514c59014d4b5c545b5d4a037d56575b581e7d51534e52575f505d5b1e715858575d5b4c1e6d4a5f505a5750591e7d515353574a4a5b5b1e131e705f4a5f52575b1e6a47505f50" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">CHICOMOFFSTA</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__8">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Clearing & Deliveries Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses current events and upcoming industry initiatives,  including new product rollouts, which impact the US marketplace. Examines automation of processes with CCPs.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Don Byron</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to Operations Americas Division members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#dcbab3aea9b1af9cbab5bdf2b3aebbe3afa9beb6b9bfa8e19fb0b9bdaeb5b2bbfcf9eeeafc98b9b0b5aab9aeb5b9affc9fb3b1b1b5a8a8b9b9fcf1fc98b3b2fc9ea5aeb3b2" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Operations Americas Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">CLEDEL</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__9">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Commitment of Traders reports Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Responds to the CFTC’s May 2026 request for comment on its Commitment of Traders reports.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#70161f02051d03301619115e1f02174f0305121a1513044d331f1d1d19041d151e04501f165024021114150203500215001f02040350271f021b191e175037021f0500505d503e1104111c19155024091e111e" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">COMTRAREP</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__10">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Commodities Committee Europe</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Provides updates on developments in commodity markets related to regulation and compliance issues and provides an opportunity for members to engage on advocacy work , including consultation responses, position letters and more.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Christiane Leuthier</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2b4d44595e46586b4d424a0544594c14585e49414e485f1668444646444f425f424e580b68444646425f5f4e4e0b6e5e59445b4e0b060b68435942585f424a454e0b674e5e5f43424e59" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Commodities</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">COMEUR</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__11">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Commodities Committee US</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Identifies, monitors and addresses regulatory and compliance issues affecting commodity end users and firms that transact in the physical metals, energy and agricultural and related derivatives markets.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7e18110c0b130d3e18171f50110c19410d0b1c141b1d0a433d111313111a170a171b0d5e3d111313170a0a1b1b5e2b2d5e535e33171d161f1b125e2d110c0c1b1212" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Commodities</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">COMUS</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__12">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Compliance Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discussion of compliance issues, regulations and to work on projects such as block trade guidance and market conduct training</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>John Graham</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#690f061b1c041a290f000847061b0e561a1c0b030c0a1d542a060419050008070a0c492a060404001d1d0c0c49444923060107492e1b08010804" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">COM</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__13">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Compute Derivatives Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Analyzes and responds to the CFTC consultation on compute derivatives published in August 2026.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#84e2ebf6f1e9f7c4e2ede5aaebf6e3bbf7f1e6eee1e7f0b9c7ebe9f4f1f0e1a4c0e1f6edf2e5f0edf2e1f7a4d3ebf6efedeae3a4c3f6ebf1f4a4a9a4cae5f0e5e8ede1a4d0fdeae5ea" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">CMPTDRVTVSWG</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__14">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Deliveries Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Examines solutions to mitigate risks that clearing members face during the expiry and physical delivery of derivatives contracts.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Stuart Bailey</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to Operations Committee Europe participants.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ee88819c9b839dae88878fc0819c89d19d9b8c848b8d9ad3aa8b8287988b9c878b9dceb9819c85878089cea99c819b9ecec3cebd9a9b8f9c9aceac8f87828b97" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Operations Committee Europe</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">DEL</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__15">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Digital Assets Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews the CFTC's, and other regulatory initiatives, involving regulation of digital assets and DLTs.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d9bfb6abacb4aa99bfb0b8f7b6abbee6aaacbbb3bcbaade49db0beb0adb8b5f998aaaabcadaaf99ab6b4b4b0adadbcbcf9f4f997b8adb8b5b0bcf98da0b7b8b7" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">DIGASS</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__16">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Drafting ToB Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses and actively participates in updating the existing FIA Terms of Business (‘Regulatory Patch’), drafting the FIA Terms of Business and the User Guide with a view to creating a modern, streamlined, state-of-the-art suite of industry standard clien</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Mitja Siraj</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#a9cfc6dbdcc4dae9cfc0c887c6dbce96dadccbc3cccadd94eddbc8cfddc0c7ce89fdc6eb89fec6dbc2c0c7ce89eedbc6dcd9898489e4c0ddc3c889fac0dbc8c3" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">DRATOB</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__17">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>EMIR 3 Margin Transparency Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Assesses the practical implications of ESMA's final draft RTS on margin transparency under EMIR. Works to develop a shared understanding of compliance requirements, identify critical dependencies on CCP implementation, and establish common industry approa</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Doanh Le Ngoc</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request Information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3e58514c4b534d7e58575f10514c59014d4b5c545b5d4a037b73776c1e0d1e735f4c5957501e6a4c5f504d4e5f4c5b505d471e69514c555750591e794c514b4e1e131e7a515f50561e725b1e7059515d" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>CCP Risk</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EMI3MARTRA</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__18">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>EMIR 3.0 impact on US FCMs Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews EU consultations that implement fee disclosures and margin transparency requirements, for impacts on FCMs.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#32545d40475f4172545b531c5d40550d414750585751460f777f7b6012011c02125b5f42535146125d5c1267611274717f4112655d40595b5c551275405d4742121f127f5b515a53575e12615d4040575e5e" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EMI30IMPUSFCM</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__19">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>EMIR 3.0 Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews and agrees FIA’s advocacy position on CCP equivalence & access to TC-CCPs and to the European Market Infrastructure Regulation at Level 1 & 2</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Jean Pierre Salendres</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#92f4fde0e7ffe1d2f4fbf3bcfde0f5ade1e7f0f8f7f1e6afd7dfdbc0b2a1bca2b2c5fde0f9fbfcf5b2d5e0fde7e2b2bfb2d8f7f3fcb2c2fbf7e0e0f7b2c1f3fef7fcf6e0f7e1" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EMI30</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__20">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>EMIR Refit Reporting Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses EMIR reporting rule changes under EMIR Refit and UK EMIR. Creates best practice documentation and considers advocacy efforts.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>John Graham</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7f19100d0a120c3f19161e51100d18400c0a1d151a1c0b423a32362d5f2d1a19160b5f2d1a0f100d0b1611185f28100d141611185f380d100a0f5f525f351017115f380d1e171e12" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>EMIR Reporting Working Group</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EMIREFREP</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__21">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>EMIR Reporting FIA/EACH Joint Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Facilitates discussion between clearing members and CCPs on future regulatory reporting changes due to come into effect in 2024. Works to resolve many of the challenges facing reporting entities and to prepare industry best practices. Jointly managed by F</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>John Graham</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#26404954534b5566404f4708495441195553444c4345521b636b6f74067443564954524f484106606f67096367656e066c494f4852067149544d4f4841066154495356060b066c494e48066154474e474b" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EMIREPFIAJOI</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__22">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Energy Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Identifies, monitors and addresses regulatory developments and day-to-day compliance issues in energy markets across Europe.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Christiane Leuthier</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to members who are energy market participants</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#a7c1c8d5d2cad4e7c1cec689c8d5c098d4d2c5cdc2c4d39ae2c9c2d5c0de87e4c8cacaced3d3c2c2878a87e4cfd5ced4d3cec6c9c287ebc2d2d3cfcec2d5" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Commodities</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">ENE</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__23">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>ETrading Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses key issues impacting electronically traded exchange-traded derivatives. Primarily focuses on issues related to regulation, vendor trading platforms and trading efficiency, in conjunction with working with exchanges, ISVs and other market partici</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Tessa Jones</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1e78716c6b736d5e78777f30716c79216d6b7c747b7d6a235b4a6c7f7a7770793e5d717373776a6a7b7b3e333e4a7b6d6d7f3e5471707b6d" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">ETR</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__24">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Event Contracts Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Addresses legal and compliance considerations related to event contracts</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#76101904031b0536101f1758190411490503141c1315024b330013180256351918020417150205562119041d1f1811563104190306565b56381702171a1f1356220f181718" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EVECON</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__25">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Events & Education Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Provides updates and educations on market events, topics, and industry fundamentals. Raises funds through annual events for charitable giving, as well as provides opportunities to build relationships and network with like-minded individuals.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Don Byron</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to Operations Americas Division members.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#45232a3730283605232c246b2a37227a3630272f202631780033202b313665607773650021302624312c2a2b65062a28282c31312020656865012a2b65073c372a2b" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Operations Americas Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Strategic</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EVEEDU</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__26">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Exchange Fees Processing Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Addresses known operational and processing inefficiencies in the administration of exchange and clearing fees. (Fees levels or any topic that could be construed as anti-competitive or in breach of anti-trust laws, rules and regulation as per the FIA’s Cod</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Stuart Bailey</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#50363f22253d23103639317e3f22376f2325323a3533246d15283338313e373570163535237000223f33352323393e3770073f223b393e377017223f2520707d70032425312224701231393c3529" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Operations Committee Europe</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EXCFEEPRO</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__27">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Exchange Risk Controls Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Established to focus on exchange risk controls, following market disruption events & the energy crisis in 2022. Works to promote education and create industry best practices. Responds to consultations and advocates with regulators and exchanges on behalf</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Jackie Mesa</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2e48415c5b435d6e48474f00415c49115d5b4c444b4d5a136b564d464f40494b0e7c475d450e6d41405a5c41425d0e79415c454740490e695c415b5e0e030e644f4d45474b0e634b5d4f" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Strategic</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">EXCRISCON</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__28">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Financial Management Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Fosters education and understanding of practices and regulations, and advocates for clarity and rule changes that protect and enhance the integrity of the industry.  Topics include financial, collateral, and margin management practices, as well as regulat</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Allison Lurton</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to Operations Americas Division members.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#f3959c81869e80b3959a92dd9c8194cc80869199969087ceb59a9d929d909a929fd3be929d9294969e969d87d3b09c9e9e9a87879696d3ded3b29f9f9a809c9dd3bf8681879c9d" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Operations Americas Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">FINMAN</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__29">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Gilt Repo Clearing UK Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Examines regulatory and market developments in the UK with respect to the gilt repo market, focusing on central clearing of gilt repos. Responds to the Bank of England Discussion Paper on the resilience of the gilt repo market.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Mitja Siraj</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Available upon request</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#46202934332b3506202f2768293421793533242c2325327b012f2a32661423362966052a2327342f282166130d661129342d2f2821660134293336666b660b2f322c2766152f34272c" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">GILREPCLEUK</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__30">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Give-Up Agreements Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews and updates the FIA Standard Customer Give-Up Agreements</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6a0c05181f07192a0c030b4405180d55191f08000f091e572d031c0f473f1a4a2b0d180f0f070f041e194a29050707031e1e0f0f4a474a240b1e0b06030f4a3e13040b04" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Strategic</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">GIVAGR</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__31">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Government Affairs Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Collaborates in developing and executing a political engagement strategy with Members of Congress, U.S. regulatory agencies and other key policymakers. Provides member firms the opportunity to highlight priorities for the group to consider and to receive</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Darin Guries</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request Information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#dcbab3aea9b1af9cbab5bdf2b3aebbe3afa9beb6b9bfa8e19bb3aab9aeb2b1b9b2a8fc9dbababdb5aeaffc9fb3b1b1b5a8a8b9b9fcf1fc98bdaeb5b2fc9ba9aeb5b9af" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Government Relations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">GOVAFF</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__32">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Government Relations Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Provides updates on all EU and UK regulatory developments and advocacy meetings in all key focus areas of FIA (e.g. MiFID, EMIR, Commodities, consultation responses).</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Adeshini Naidoo</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#12747d60677f6152747b733c7d60752d616770787771662f557d6477607c7f777c663240777e73667b7d7c6132517d7f7f7b66667777323f32537677617a7b7c7b325c737b767d7d" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Government Relations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">GOVREL</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__33">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>IAS 32 Legal opinions Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses legal aspects of the International Accounting Standard 32, specifically the legal opinions that firms need to satisfy this accounting standard. The group's current focus is on CM - CCP exposures.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Mitja Siraj</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Available upon request</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1e78716c6b736d5e78777f30716c79216d6b7c747b7d6a23575f4d3e2d2c3e527b797f723e716e77707771706d3e49716c757770793e596c716b6e3e333e53776a747f3e4d776c7f74" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Legal Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">IAS32LEGOPI</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__34">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Industry Resilience Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Focuses on all forms of operational resilience, including but not limited to cyber resilience. Discusses cyber incident management, resilience planning and recommends best practices for the industry. This committee was established from a recommendation by</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Don Byron</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d7b1b8a5a2baa497b1beb6f9b8a5b0e8a4a2b5bdb2b4a3ea9eb9b3a2a4a3a5aef785b2a4bebbbeb2b9b4b2f794b8bababea3a3b2b2f7faf793b8b9f795aea5b8b9" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">INDRES</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__35">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>JAC Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Explores issues related to the separate account margin management issues stemming from various CFTC no-action letters</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Allison Lurton</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#5b3d34292e36281b3d323a7534293c64282e39313e382f66111a187b18343636322f2f3e3e7b767b1a3737322834357b172e292f3435" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">JAC</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__36">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>JAC Margins Handbook Update Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Identifies areas of the JAC Margins Handbook that need updating due to regulatory and operational developments since the Handbook's initial publication. Provides member feedback to the JAC for consideration in any new published version.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2f49405d5a425c6f49464e01405d48105c5a4d454a4c5b12656e6c0f624e5d4846415c0f674e414b4d4040440f7a5f4b4e5b4a0f78405d444641480f685d405a5f0f020f62464c474e4a430f7c405d5d4a4343" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Financial Management Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">JACMARHANUPD</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__37">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Law & Compliance Division</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Monitors legal and regulatory developments affecting the futures and derivatives industry, assisting FIA in providing information to help relevant regulators and courts make decisions that affect the cleared derivatives industry</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Allison Lurton</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members. Individual subscription to the Division required.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#40262f32352d33002629216e2f32277f3335222a2523347d0c21376065727660032f2d302c29212e2325600429362933292f2e606d60012c2c29332f2e600c3532342f2e" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">LAWCOMDIV</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__38">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Law, Risk & Compliance Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Identifies, monitors and addresses legal and regulatory developments affecting the exchange traded and centrally cleared derivatives industry across the Asia-Pacific region.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Tze Min Yeo</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#82e4edf0f7eff1c2e4ebe3acedf0e5bdf1f7e0e8e7e1f6bfcee3f5aea2d0ebf1e9a2a7b0b4a2c1edeff2eeebe3ece1e7a2c1edefefebf6f6e7e7a2afa2d6f8e7a2cfebeca2dbe7ed" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Asia Pacific</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">LAWRISCOM</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__39">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Legal Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses legal, regulatory, capital and other issues, as they relate to OTC and ETD derivatives clearing, which includes both CCP and client-   facing aspects, as well as looking at industry standard contractual arrangements that firms need to put in pla</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Mitja Siraj</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#57313825223a2417313e3679382530682422353d3234236a1b3230363b7714383a3a3e23233232777a771a3e233d3677043e25363d" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">LEG</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__40">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Mandatory CCP Provisions Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews Mandatory CCP Provisions in CCP Rulebooks (i.e., provisions that the CCPs require their members to include in client clearing agreements) and identifies gaps with the FIA ToBs. Where gaps are found, industry standard language that clearing firms c</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Mitja Siraj</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Available upon request</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#04626b7671697744626d652a6b76633b7771666e6167703949656a6065706b767d244747542454766b726d776d6b6a7724536b766f6d6a632443766b7174242924496d706e6524576d76656e" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Legal Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">MANCCPPRO</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__41">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Market Infrastructure and Supervision Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses advocacy priorities and draft position papers in response to the European Commission's market integration package, including proposed changes for centralisation of supervision in the EU, ESMA mandate and governance, commodities, and CCP Recovery</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Jean Pierre Salendres</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ef89809d9a829caf89868ec1809d88d09c9a8d858a8c9bd2a28e9d848a9bcfa681899d8e9c9b9d9a8c9b9a9d8acf8e818bcfbc9a9f8a9d99869c868081cfb8809d84868188cfa89d809a9fcfc2cfa58a8e81cfbf868a9d9d8acfbc8e838a818b9d8a9c" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">MARINFSUP</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__42">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Metals Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Identifies, monitors and addresses regulatory developments and day-to-day compliance issues in metals markets across Europe.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Christiane Leuthier</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to members who are metal market participants. Bio required from potential new members and approval by the committee.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#22444d50574f5162444b430c4d50451d515740484741561f6f4756434e5102614d4f4f4b56564747020f02614a504b51564b434c47026e4757564a4b4750" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Commodities</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">MET</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__43">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>MiFIR Reporting Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses reporting obligations set out in MiFIR.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>John Graham</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#aec8c1dcdbc3ddeec8c7cf80c1dcc991dddbccc4cbcdda93e3c7e8e7fc8efccbdec1dcdac7c0c98ef9c1dcc5c7c0c98ee9dcc1dbde8e838ee4c1c6c08ee9dccfc6cfc3" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">MIFREP2</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__44">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Netting Opinions Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Develops Netting Opinions in primary jurisdictions where FCMs operate and provides periodic updates to opinions.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b8ded7cacdd5cbf8ded1d996d7cadf87cbcddad2dddbcc85f6ddccccd1d6df98f7c8d1d6d1d7d6cb98fbd7d5d5d1ccccdddd989598f5d1dbd0d9ddd498ebd7cacaddd4d4" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">NETOPI</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__45">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>OCR Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Develop advocacy strategy for codification and revision of CFTC Ownership and Control Reporting rules and monitor for implementation</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to Law & Compliance and Operations Americas Division members.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#bbddd4c9ced6c8fbddd2da95d4c9dc84c8ced9d1ded8cf86f4f8e99becd4c9d0d2d5dc9bfcc9d4cecb9b969bf5dacfdad7d2de9befc2d5dad5" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">OCR</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__46">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Operational Considerations for CME-FICC’s Customer Treasuries Cross-Margining Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Identifies and resolves operational considerations and challenges for BD-FCMs participating in CME-FICC’s cross-margining program for customer treasuries and related futures positions.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e1878e93948c92a1878880cf8e9386de9294838b848295dcae9184938095888e8f808dc1a2aca4cca7a8a2a2c1a2938e9292ccac809386888f888f86c1a89292948492c1b68e938a888f86c1a6938e9491c1ccc1ac88828980848dc1b28e9393848d8d" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Executive Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">OPECONCMECUS</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__47">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Operational Resilience Policy Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews and agrees FIA’s advocacy position on operational resilience policies and regulation in the EU and in the UK. Responds to ongoing operational resilience consultations from the European Commission, European Supervisory Authorities, ECB, Bank of Eng</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Jean Pierre Salendres</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#cbada4b9bea6b88bada2aae5a4b9acf4b8bea9a1aea8bff684bbaeb9aabfa2a4a5aaa7eb99aeb8a2a7a2aea5a8aeeb9ba4a7a2a8b2eb88a4a6a6a2bfbfaeaeebe6eb81aeaaa5eb9ba2aeb9b9aeeb98aaa7aea5afb9aeb8" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">OPERESPOL</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__48">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Operations Americas Division</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Promotes industry cooperation and the exchange of ideas among FIA members throughout the Americas.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Don Byron</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#22444d50574f5162444b430c4d50451d515740484741561f6d52475043564b4d4c5102634f47504b41435102664b544b514b4d4c020f02664d4c02605b504d4c" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">OPEAMEDIV</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__49">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Operations Committee APAC</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Focuses on the operational aspects of the trading and clearing of exchange-traded and centrally cleared derivatives. Aims to identify and address issues relating to minimising operational risk, increasing efficiency and improving operational systems and p</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Stella Gan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#187e776a6d756b587e717936776a7f276b6d7a727d7b6c2557687d6a796c7177766b385b777575716c6c7d7d385948595b3835384b6c7d747479385f7976" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Asia Pacific</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">OPEAPA</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__50">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Operations Committee Europe</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Addresses issues relating to the post-trade clearing and processing of OTC and exchange-traded derivatives. Focuses on regulatory changes which impact upon the operational aspects of derivatives clearing, CCP and vendor liaison regarding change management</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Stuart Bailey</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#57313825223a2417313e3679382530682422353d3234236a1827322536233e3839247714383a3a3e2323323277122225382732777a770423223625237715363e3b322e" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">OPEEUR</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__51">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Part 20 Swaps Large Trader Reporting Sunset Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Prepares a formal request to the CFTC to sunset its Part 20 large trader reporting regime for commodity swaps, and coordinates related advocacy.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#0e68617c7b637d4e68676f20617c69317d7b6c646b6d7a335e6f7c7a2e3c3e2e5d796f7e7d2e426f7c696b2e5a7c6f6a6b7c2e5c6b7e617c7a6760692e5d7b607d6b7a2e59617c656760692e497c617b7e2e232e43676d666f6b622e5d617c7c6b6262" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">PAR20SWALARTRA</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__52">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Portfolio Margining RFC Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews the CFTC/SEC joint request for comment on how to harmonize and streamline the agencies’ approval and oversight of portfolio and cross-margining programs.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9afcf5e8eff7e9dafcf3fbb4f5e8fda5e9eff8f0fff9eea7caf5e8eefcf5f6f3f5bad7fbe8fdf3f4f3f4fdbac8dcd9bacdf5e8f1f3f4fdbadde8f5efeabab7bad7f3f9f2fbfff6bac9f5e8e8fff6f6" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">POMARFCWG</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__53">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Position Limits Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Responds to the CFTC proposal on position limits and monitors implementation of the rules</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#10767f62657d63507679713e7f62772f6365727a7573642d407f637964797f7e305c797d79646330477f627b797e773057627f6560303d305d79737871757c30437f6262757c7c" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Commodities Committee US</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">POSLIM</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__54">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Post-Trade Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Addresses post-trade technology challenges and seeks to enhance operational efficiencies across post-trade processes through the adoption of industry standards, cutting-edge solutions, and fostering of a resilient and adoptive infrastructure</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Don Byron</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to Operations Americas Division members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#96f0f9e4e3fbe5d6f0fff7b8f9e4f1a9e5e3f4fcf3f5e2abc6f9e5e2bbc2e4f7f2f3b6d5f9fbfbffe2e2f3f3b6bbb6d2f9f8b6d4efe4f9f8" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Operations Americas Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">POS</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__55">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Prediction Markets Legislation Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses pending legislation before multiple state legislatures that would impose excise taxes on event contracts entered into by consumers within the state</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Darin Guries</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6d0b021f18001e2d0b040c43021f0a521e180f07080e19503d1f0809040e190402034d200c1f0608191e4d21080a041e010c190402034d3a021f0604030a4d2a1f02181d4d404d290c1f04034d2a181f04081e" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Government Relations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">PREMARLEG</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__56">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Recovery Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Examines key operational resiliency considerations for the industry when recovering from a global multi-day outage. Includes a focus on operational continuity planning for essential functions.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Stuart Bailey</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#98fef7eaedf5ebd8fef1f9b6f7eaffa7ebedfaf2fdfbeca5cafdfbf7eefdeae1b8cff7eaf3f1f6ffb8dfeaf7ede8b8b5b8cbecedf9eaecb8daf9f1f4fde1" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Industry Resilience Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">REC</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__57">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Relief for FCMs to clear Treasuries under CFTC Rule 1.25 Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Works with counsel to develop a written request to the CFTC to modify Rule 1.25 to allow FCMs to clear treasuries and repos involving customer funds, in compliance with the SEC treasury clearing mandate.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#f7919885829a84b7919e96d9988590c88482959d929483caa5929b9e9291d7919885d7b1b4ba84d78398d7949b929685d7a38592968482859e9284d78299939285d7b4b1a3b4d7a5829b92d7dad7ba9e949f96929bd7a4988585929b9b" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Executive Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">RELFCMCLETREUN</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__58">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Repo Clearing Documentation Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses FIA clearing member documentation needs, for client clearing of repos in Europe under the sponsored access models, with an objective to create an industry agreement for repo clearing in Europe and associated documentation (legal opinions, user guide, etc.)</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Mitja Siraj</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ddbbb2afa8b0ae9dbbb4bcf3b2afbae2aea8bfb7b8bea9e08fb8adb2fd9eb1b8bcafb4b3bafd99b2bea8b0b8b3a9bca9b4b2b3fd8ab2afb6b4b3bafd9aafb2a8adfdf0fd90b4a9b7bcfd8eb4afbcb7" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Legal Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">RCDOC</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__59">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Reporting & Data Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews developments in the regulatory reporting space, provides updates from the various reporting working groups (including the FIA EMIR Reporting Working Group and the FIA MiFIR Reporting Working Group) and discusses advocacy efforts.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>John Graham</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9cfaf3eee9f1efdcfaf5fdb2f3eefba3efe9fef6f9ffe8a1cef9ecf3eee8f5f2fbbcb9aeaabcd8fde8fdbcdff3f1f1f5e8e8f9f9bcb1bcd6f3f4f2bcdbeefdf4fdf1" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">REPDAT</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__60">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Residual Interest Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Seeks relief from CFTC for FCMs to withdraw excess residual interest from the customer seg account in a more timely manner than is allowed under current rules.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to Operations Americas Division members.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d0b6bfa2a5bda390b6b9b1febfa2b7efa3a5b2bab5b3a4ed82b5a3b9b4a5b1bcf099bea4b5a2b5a3a4f087bfa2bbb9beb7f097a2bfa5a0f0fdf09eb1a4b1bcb9b5f084a9beb1be" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Financial Management Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">RESINT</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__61">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Retail Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Identifies, monitors and addresses regulatory developments specific to firms with a retail focus.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Available upon request</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#42242d30372f3102242b236c2d30257d313720282721367f102736232b2e62012d2f2f2b36362727626f620c2336232e2b2762163b2c232c" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">RET</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__62">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Self-Match Prevention Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Addresses the gaps and inconsistencies in self-match prevention tools and creates a consistent approach to the technical  implementation of same at exchange and software vendor levels.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Tessa Jones</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Available upon request</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7e18110c0b130d3e18171f50110c19410d0b1c141b1d0a432d1b121853331f0a1d165e2e0c1b081b100a1711105e29110c151710195e390c110b0e5e535e2a1b0d0d1f5e3411101b0d" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>ETrading Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Technology</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">SELPRE</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__63">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Single Stock Futures Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Analyses NFA and FINRA requirements for security futures and generates proposals for updates</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ea8c85989f8799aa8c838bc485988dd5999f88808f899ed7b983848d868fcab99e858981caac9f9e9f988f99cabd85988183848dcaad98859f9acac7caa48b9e8b86838fcabe93848b84" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">SINSTOFUT</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__64">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Surveillance Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses monitoring and surveillance obligations in an era of increasingly complex products, systems, AI and enhanced scrutiny from regulatory bodies.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>John Graham</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#fa9c95888f9789ba9c939bd495889dc5898f98909f998ec7a98f888c9f9396969b94999fdab9959797938e8e9f9fdad7dab0959294dabd889b929b97" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">SUR</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__65">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Sustainable Finance Distribution list</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Distributes updates on developments relating to sustainable finance and its impact on the cleared derivatives market</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>John Graham</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members.</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1e78716c6b736d5e78777f30716c79216d6b7c747b7d6a234d6b6d6a7f77707f7c727b3e5877707f707d7b3e5a776d6a6c777c6b6a7771703e72776d6a3e333e547176703e596c7f767f73" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Strategic</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Distribution List</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">SUSFINDISLIS</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__66">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>T+1 Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Helps prepare for deliverable equity ETDs to move to T+1 settlement, by market convention, ahead of T+1 settlement coming into force on 11 October 2027. The remit includes development of best practices for moving physically deliverable equity ETDs to T+1,</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Stuart Bailey</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Available upon request</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#fe98918c8b938dbe98979fd0918c99c18d8b9c949b9d8ac3aad5cfdea9918c95979099deb98c918b8eded3dead8a8b9f8c8adebc9f97929b87" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Operations Committee Europe</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Operations</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">T1</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__67">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Technology Vendors Committee</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Discusses matters relevant to software vendor firms in Europe, including exchange upgrades, regulatory proposals and operational challenges. Considers development of industry best practice.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Stuart Bailey</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to software vendor member firms</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b1d7dec3c4dcc2f1d7d8d09fdec3d68ec2c4d3dbd4d2c58ce5d4d2d9dfdeddded6c891e7d4dfd5dec3c291f2dedcdcd8c5c5d4d4919c91e2c5c4d0c3c591f3d0d8ddd4c8" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Global</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Technology</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Committee</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">TECVEN</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__68">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Tokenisation/DLT Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Coordinates advocacy on key EU and UK policy developments related to tokenisation and DLT. Provides a forum to exchange views and align FIA responses to upcoming consultations on tokenisation in the UK, central bank settlement infrastructure (RTGS/CHAPS),</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Jean Pierre Salendres</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#83e5ecf1f6eef0c3e5eae2adecf1e4bcf0f6e1e9e6e0f7bed7ece8e6edeaf0e2f7eaecedacc7cfd7a3d4ecf1e8eaede4a3c4f1ecf6f3a3aea3c9e6e2eda3d3eae6f1f1e6a3d0e2efe6ede7f1e6f0" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Europe</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">TOK2</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__69">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Tokenization Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Examines the operational, technological, legal, regulatory and compliance issues associated with tokenization of assets for margin, collateral, and settlement for US derivatives market participants.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Natalie Tynan</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e98f869b9c849aa98f8088c7869b8ed69a9c8b838c8a9dd4bd86828c878093889d808687c9be869b8280878ec9ae9b869c99c9c4c9a7889d8885808cc9bd90878887" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Executive Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">TOK</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__70">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Treasury Clearing Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews SEC, FICC and CFTC rules relating to clearing of US treasuries and repos to ensure continued access to such markets for FCMs.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Allison Lurton</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Request information</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#25434a5750485665434c440b4a57421a5650474f40465118715740445650575c0566494044574c4b4205724a574e4c4b420562574a50550508056449494c564a4b05695057514a4b" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Executive Committee</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Legal/Compliance</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">TRECLE</td>
								</tr><tr class="rgAltRow" id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ctl00__71">
									<td><div class="CommitteeList-tile"><h4>Treatment of Letters of Credit under CFTC Margin Rules Working Group</h4><div class="tile-body"><div class="tile-left"><p>Reviews the treatment of letters of credit under CFTC rules and considers engagement with CFTC to make LOCs more beneficial for FCMs and customers in managing margin requirements.</p><p><strong>FIA Contact</strong></p><p>Michael Sorrell</p><p><strong>Participation Criteria</strong></p><p>Open to all members</p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#a3c5ccd1d6ced0e3c5cac28dccd1c49cd0d6c1c9c6c0d79ef7d1c6c2d7cec6cdd783ccc583efc6d7d7c6d1d083ccc583e0d1c6c7cad783d6cdc7c6d183e0e5f7e083eec2d1c4cacd83f1d6cfc6d0838e83eecac0cbc2c6cf83f0ccd1d1c6cfcf" class = "button">Request Information</a></div><div class="tile-right"><p><strong>Parent</strong></p><p>Law & Compliance Division</p><p><strong>Region</strong></p><p>Americas</p><p><strong>Theme</strong></p><p>Regulatory</p><p><strong>Type</strong></p><p>Working Group</p></div></div></div></td><td style="display:none;">TRELETCREUNDCF</td>
								</tr>
								</tbody>

							</table><div id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_SharedCalendarContainer" style="display:none;">

							</div><input id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ClientState" name="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_Grid1_ClientState" type="hidden" />    </div>
							<div id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_BottomButtonPanel">
								<div id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_LeftBottomPanel" class="pull-left">

								</div><div id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciMemberForums_ciMemberForums_ResultsGrid_RightBottomPanel" class="pull-right">
